        },
        "text": "We use Grok Bot to spot incidents in our support queue and quickly respond to every associated ticket.\n\nIn one incident, it cleared 204 tickets in about 10 minutes, with one engineer approving the batch. https://t.co/eCPXr8lZoM"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "778282085433876480",
        "conversation_id": "2112613164357755166",
        "created_at": "2026-10-20T18:33:23.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
