        ],
        "id": "2112613164357755166",
        "lang": "en",
        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {
            "mentions": [
              {
                "end": 839,
                "id": "1720665183188922368",
                "start": 834,
                "username": "grok"
              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "I know I’m a bit late to the party, but I’m seriously impressed with what Grok Bot has accomplished in its first ~24 hours.\n\nHere’s the summary it pulled together:\n\n💸 Got about $1,000 back from an airline: a refund on a seat upgrade plus reimbursement for a flight disruption\n📦 Disputing a bogus customs fee from a shipper, and talked me out of a \"fix\" that would've cost more than the fee\n📭 Unsubscribed me from 66 junk email lists, plus 19 kinds of LinkedIn spam\n✈️ Planned logistics and made a lunch reservation for an upcoming NYC trip\n🛒 Read a month of my grocery orders and learned what our family of 9 actually buys\n🧾 Dug up a forgotten tax payment and checked where I stand before year-end\n🏈 Took over my fantasy team: waiver claims and a weekly lineup schedule\nAnd it handled the logins and verification codes along the way. @grok"
        },
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 88,
          "impression_count": 31691,
          "like_count": 393,
          "quote_count": 3,
          "reply_count": 25,
          "retweet_count": 13
        },
        "text": "I know I’m a bit late to the party, but I’m seriously impressed with what Grok Bot has accomplished in its first ~24 hours.\n\nHere’s the summary it pulled together:\n\n💸 Got about $1,000 back from an airline: a refund on a seat upgrade plus reimbursement for a flight disruption\n📦"
